					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300306,
					"content": "欸~！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300309,
					"content": "我現在要做的修行是留雲真君為我安排的，旨在幫我找回一些作為仙人的感覺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300310,
					"content": "#雖然其中融入了些她的風格和趣味…但願不會讓{F#妳}{M#你}們對仙人有所誤解。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300311,
					"content": "會、會很難嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300312,
					"content": "不會，旅者的實力我已知曉，體內隱藏的力量不遜於我等。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300313,
					"content": "做好準備的話，就開始吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300307,
					"content": "想體驗一下仙人的修行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300308
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110300308,
					"content": "#原來如此，{F#妳}{M#你}們對仙家修行感興趣啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
