				{
					"id": 110300414,
					"content": "欸！原來是魈嗎！那個冷冰冰的特立獨行的傢伙，居然會幫妳安排修行？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300415,
						110300416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300415,
					"content": "令人驚訝…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300417
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110300417,
					"content": "一開始，我也覺得他很難以接近。但我想…能夠面對他，也是「歸隱」重要的一環。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300418,
					"content": "#他應該已經在等我了，有興趣的話，{F#妳}{M#你}們也可以跟來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300419,
					"content": "#當然有興趣！{NICKNAME}我們也去吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 110300416,
					"content": "令人很感興趣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300417
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110300410,
					"content": "是削月築陽真君的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300411
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110300404,
					"content": "當仙人真是辛苦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 110300405,
					"content": "辛苦嗎…不僅仙人如此，世間眾生也是如此吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						110300406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "甘雨"
				}
			]
		},
